Description: Interface around 'JDemetra+ 3.x'
    (<https://github.com/jdemetra/jdplus-nowcasting>), TSACE project.  It
    defines and estimates Dynamic Factor Models with the purpose of
    Nowcasting. News analysis is included in this second version.
